  triage:resolutionNote "quality-mgr BB-GATE2-QA1-1789288411 (PR #1485, report 01M2CZ2MNJ14WHNB6FW75G1CS4): outcome field + assertion added, 71/71 storage_and_nudge_router tests pass. quality-mgr personally ran a live mutation experiment removing the outcome field and confirmed all 5 assertion sites fail as expected, then reverted cleanly, proving the guard is genuine not vacuous. req-qa + arch-qa both PASS, PR #1485 CI green." .
